{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17309","headline":"送句容王少府簿领赴上都 · 权德舆","name":"送句容王少府簿领赴上都","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上国路绵绵，行人候晓天。\n离亭绿绮奏，乡树白云连。\n江露湿征袂，山莺宜泊船。\n春风若爲别，相顾起尊前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17309.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17309","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}